From: Cryolitia PukNgae <cryolitia@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] camera: negotiate output sizes and frame intervals through V4L2

Select real sensor modes through application S_FMT/S_PARM, propagate the
returned sensor geometry, and configure an aspect-preserving TFE crop.
Use standard VT timing controls for the rear sensor's requested frame rate
and exposure. Keep the 1920x1440 default and two physical camera entries.

